    <description><![CDATA[<p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 开场</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="82">01:22</a> 对库斯图里卡作品的整体印象</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="242">04:02</a> 从电影里的视觉元素看导演的精神内涵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="817">13:37</a> 作品年表和电影故事线</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="951">15:51</a> 南斯拉夫的历史背景解读</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1101">18:21</a> 导演的美学核心和给我们的启示</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1629">27:09</a> “无烟乐队”歌曲串烧</span></p><span></span><p><span>⭐️⭐️⭐️本期涉及电影：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《爸爸去出差》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《流浪者之歌》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《地下》</span></p><span></span><p><span>《黑猫白猫》</span></p><span></span><p><span>⭐️⭐️⭐️本期涉及小说：</span></p><span></span><p><span>自传《我身在历史何处》</span></p><span></span><p><span>短篇小说集《婚姻中的陌生人》</span></p><span></span><p><span>⭐️⭐️⭐️音乐：</span></p><span></span><p><span>《流浪者之歌》原声OST：Talijanska [L'Italienne]</span></p><span></span><p><span>无烟乐队：Sas Jekh Len (There Was A River Once) ("Time of the Gypsies")</span></p><span></span><p><span>无烟乐队：Perhan Sovel (Perhan is Dreaming) ("Time of the Gypsies")</span></p>]]></description>
